# Orchestration Rules

- Open and work from the **root repo** when changes may span `retro-api` and `retro-web`.
- Route backend work to `repos/retro-api/`, frontend work to `repos/retro-web/`.
- Read root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) (sections 2–7 for app work) and [`docs/agentic-engineering.md`](../../docs/agentic-engineering.md) for Cursor workflows before editing child repos.
- Rules precedence: see `docs/rules-audit.md`.
- Follow phase scope in `PLAN.md`; do not expand v1 scope without approval.
- Coordinate API contract before UI when adding new fields or endpoints.
